NOTE ON THE 3D CHARACTER ASSET
--------------------------------
This project was forked from an open 3D portfolio template. The animated 3D
character model and its rigging/textures (public/models/character.glb,
public/models/character.enc) originate from that upstream template, whose
original license marked these specific assets as proprietary and restricted
redistribution/commercial use without the original author's written consent.
That consent has not been independently confirmed for this fork. Before
redistributing, deploying commercially, or otherwise relying on this specific
asset, verify permission with the original template author, or replace the
model with an original/licensed one.

All other source code (React/TypeScript components, styles, build config)
follows the structure of the upstream open template and may be reused/adapted
under the same terms the template was originally shared under.
